How to Run This on Your Own Machine

Clone or create a folder on your computer.

Put the files in their respective folders:

server.ts, package.json, vite.config.ts, tsconfig.json, index.html in the root.

React components in src/components/, data files in src/data/, types in src/types/.

In your terminal, run:

codeBash

npm install

Create a .env file containing:

codeEnv

GEMINI_API_KEY="YOUR_KEY_HERE" PORT=3000

Start development:

codeBash

npm run dev

Open your browser at http://localhost:3000!


